<title>USA: Ryder System Q4 Dec 31 oper shr $0.36.</title>
<headline>Ryder System Q4 Dec 31 oper shr $0.36.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fourth Quarter  Twelve Months</p>
<p>			     1996	 1995	 1996	 1995</p>
<p> Revenue	    $1,356,714  1,345,447  5,519,415  5,167,421</p>
<p>Earnings from</p>
<p>  operations (a)	29,199     56,429    117,521    155,425</p>
<p>Gain on sale of consumer</p>
<p>  truck rental	  15,078	   --     15,078	   --</p>
<p>Restructuring and other</p>
<p>  charges	    (143,614)	   --  (163,886)	   --</p>
<p>Extraordinary</p>
<p>  loss (b)	    (10,031)	   --   (10,031)	   --</p>
<p>Cumulative effect of  change in</p>
<p>  accounting (c)	    --	   --	   --    (7,759)</p>
<p>Net earnings</p>
<p>  (loss)	     (109,368)     56,429   (41,318)    147,666</p>
<p>Average common and common equivalent</p>
<p>  shares		  81,876     79,687     81,263     79,370</p>
<p>Earnings (loss) per common share:</p>
<p>Earnings from</p>
<p>   operations (a)	 0.36	 0.71	 1.45	 1.96</p>
<p>Gain on sale of consumer</p>
<p>   truck rental	   0.18	   --	 0.18	   --</p>
<p>Restructuring and other</p>
<p>   charges		(1.75)	   --     (2.02)	   --</p>
<p>Extraordinary</p>
<p>  (loss) (b)	    (0.12)	   --     (0.12)	   --</p>
<p>Cumulative effect of change in</p>
<p>   accounting (c)	   --	   --	   --     (0.10)</p>
<p>Net earnings</p>
<p>   (loss) (d)	   (1.34)	 0.71     (0.51)	 1.86</p>
<p>(a) Earnings from operations excludes the gain on sale of the consumer truck rental business, restructuring and other charges, the extraordinary loss from the early extinguishment of debt and the cumulative effect from a change in accounting.</p>
<p>(b) During the Q4 of 1996, the company retired $80 million of high coupon debt at a loss of $10.0 million after tax.</p>
<p>(c) Effective January 1, 1995, the company adopted Statement of Financial Accounting Standards No. 116, &quot;Accounting for Contributions Received and Contributions Made,&quot; resulting in a charge of $7.8 million.  </p>
<p>The cumulative effect reflects the after tax charge to establish a liability for the present value of the company's total outstanding charitable commitments as of January 1, 1995.</p>
<p>(d) Total Q4 1996 net loss per share amount does not equal the sum of the detailed components due to rounding.</p>
<p>Note:  Certain amounts for the 1995 periods have been reclassified to conform to 1996 classifications.</p>
<p>Note: Full name is Ryder System Inc.</p>
<p>Periods ended Dec 31, 1996 and 1995</p>
<p>(In thousands, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
